    ├── Pitfalls   : ujson historically did not support the `separators` keyword argument in the same way as stdlib json, which could break the compact ',',':'
    │   formatting requirement; ujson's sort_keys behavior and float/number formatting can differ slightly from stdlib json, risking byte-level non-determinism
